{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00024","headline":"登三台言志 · 太宗皇帝","name":"登三台言志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未央初壮汉，阿房昔侈秦。\n在危犹骋丽，居奢遂役人。\n岂如家四海，日宇罄朝伦。\n扇天裁户旧，砌地翦基新。\n引月擎宵桂，飘云逼曙鳞。\n露除光炫玉，霜阙映雕银。\n舞接花梁燕，歌迎鸟路尘。\n镜池波太液，庄苑丽宜春。\n作异甘泉日，停非路寝辰。\n念劳慙逸己，居旷返劳神。\n所欣成大厦，宏材伫渭滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}